 — the quiet glacier village to Zermatt''s Matterhorn headliner; pairs on one Valais itinerary","No natural hot springs in-village; Valais thermal baths at Leukerbad are a scenic down-valley day-trip"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 / 117 police / 118 fire / 144 ambulance / 1414 REGA alpine air-rescue / 145 poison","hospital":"Visp/Brig (Spital Visp / Oberwallis) down-valley; local village medical practice for day cases; REGA 1414 alpine/glacier evac","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"Glacier ski area — avalanche AND crevasse risk: SLF five-level bulletin (slf.ch/White Risk), transceiver/shovel/probe + qualified guide off-piste, glacier off-piste roped-and-guided only, altitude/AMS (Mittelallalin ~3,500 m), sudden whiteouts; car-free village = strong child-safety upside; rescue REGA 1414","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/switzerland","read":"2026-09-01T16:18:43Z","page_updated":"2026-08-11T10:23:45+01:00","source_country":"switzerland","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter — Christmas/NY, Feb half-terms, Easter — glacier skiing + family ski weeks","shoulder":"Early Dec opening + late-season April spring glacier skiing; summer-ski window ~mid-Jul on","green":"May-Jun + late Sep-Nov (some lifts/hotels close for maintenance — verify)","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Feb + Easter + top hotels 3-8 mo; regular winter 2-4 mo; summer-glacier/hiking 1-3 mo","off_season_specials":"Summer glacier skiing + hiking/climbing (Jul-Sep); spring-ski value (April); autumn wellness","event_peaks":"Ski holidays (Dec-Apr), summer-glacier training season (Jul-Aug), Christmas/NY (verify live events calendar)","fire_date":"Next winter + family weeks by Jun-Sep; summer-glacier + hiking from spring; spring-ski from Jan"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ride the Metro Alpin to Mittelallalin — the roof of the ski